<title>USA: Lomak Petroleum to trade on NYSE Friday.</title>
<headline>Lomak Petroleum to trade on NYSE Friday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The common stock of Lomak Petroleum Inc is scheduled to begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) on Friday under the symbol LOM.N, according to a statement released by NYSE on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its stock now trades on Nasdaq.</p>
